    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2153\"><em data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2153\">(6th Level)</em></p><p><strong>Administrative Pressure:</strong> +1</p><p data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2199\">You establish a controlled enforcement zone.</p><p data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2288\">Create a defined area where escalation becomes expensive for the duration of the scene.</p><p data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2306\">Within the zone:</p><ul data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2453\"><li data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2352\"><p data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2352\">Violent escalation may impose roll 3d10 keep lowest 2,</p></li><li data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2396\"><p data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2396\">Manifesting may require additional cost,</p></li><li data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2453\"><p data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2453\">Divine or extraplanar abilities strain or destabilize.</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2463\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2502\">Spend 1 Civic Charge die to establish.</p><h3 data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2519\">Interaction</h3><p data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2596\">Targets marked Out of Compliance suffer increased penalties inside the zone.</p><h3 data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2610\">Pushback</h3><p data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2692\">Quarantine zones attract attention from authorities, patrons, and rival mandates.</p>",
